Markdown compatibility
========================================================
author: RStudio
autosize: true

Text and equations
========================================================

**Bold**, *italic*, `code`, snake_case and ~~deleted~~ text.

"Smart quotes", don't, --, --- and ...

x^2 and x^(a + b), with $x_1 + x^2$ and $$a_b < c_d$$.

Links and lists
========================================================

- [Website](https://example.com)
- Bare URL: https://example.com
- [Relative link](other.html)
    - Nested item

> A quotation with **formatting**.

Tables
========================================================

Left | Right
:--- | ---:
one | two
three | four

Code
========================================================

```{r}
summary(cars)
```

```cpp
if (x < 2) return "<escaped>";
```

```text
$not_math$ and x^2
```

Plot
========================================================

```{r, echo=FALSE}
plot(cars)
```

Authored HTML
========================================================

<div class="custom">
<strong>Authored HTML</strong>
</div>

<video id="example" controls src="example.mp4"></video>
